WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.269 --> 00:00:04.607
(door creaking)

00:00:04.607 --> 00:00:07.190
(upbeat music)

00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:09.013
- I'm Zac Young.

00:00:09.013 --> 00:00:11.440
I'm the Pastry Director for
Craveable Hospitality Group.

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:13.290
I've been a pastry chef for 12 years.

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:16.950
Today, I am eating cake out of a box.

00:00:22.090 --> 00:00:23.010
It looks pretty good.

00:00:23.010 --> 00:00:23.843
Solid cake.

00:00:23.843 --> 00:00:25.440
Spongy.

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:28.190
I feel like everyone had this
for their birthday growing up,

00:00:28.190 --> 00:00:29.120
except for me.

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:29.953
Thanks, mom.

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:34.210
It has a little bit of
artificial vanilla flavor,

00:00:34.210 --> 00:00:36.150
but I think that's what cake mix is about.

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:37.210
The texture's great.

00:00:37.210 --> 00:00:38.070
It's moist,

00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:40.090
almost like impossibly moist.

00:00:40.090 --> 00:00:41.064
You could put a dish sponge

00:00:41.064 --> 00:00:43.000
and layer it with chocolate frosting

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:44.930
and give it to me and
it would look the same.

00:00:44.930 --> 00:00:47.990
This is your base model box of cake.

00:00:47.990 --> 00:00:48.823
Two and a half.

00:00:48.823 --> 00:00:50.163
It's basic and everyone can have it.

00:00:50.163 --> 00:00:52.996
(classical music)

00:00:55.069 --> 00:00:55.902
Ah ha!

00:00:55.902 --> 00:00:57.510
I'm guessing this is
going to be spice cake.

00:00:57.510 --> 00:00:58.343
It looks good.

00:00:58.343 --> 00:00:59.176
It's springy.

00:00:59.176 --> 00:01:00.940
It smells spicy.

00:01:02.320 --> 00:01:03.730
Flavor is really good.

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:06.630
It's not too strong, you
get a nice hint of nutmeg,

00:01:06.630 --> 00:01:09.950
but the cake itself is
almost unnervingly damp.

00:01:09.950 --> 00:01:10.783
Marshy.

00:01:10.783 --> 00:01:11.890
The spice flavor's good though

00:01:11.890 --> 00:01:14.700
and the texture, it's oddly crumbly.

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:17.950
It's warm, it reminds
me of fall, two stars.

00:01:24.740 --> 00:01:26.030
It looks good, it looks red.

00:01:26.030 --> 00:01:27.637
That's red velvet.

00:01:27.637 --> 00:01:28.552
It feels nice.

00:01:28.552 --> 00:01:30.330
Kinda feels like a loofah.

00:01:31.596 --> 00:01:32.429
It's like a little dry.

00:01:32.429 --> 00:01:34.700
There should be a little
hint of cocoa in there.

00:01:34.700 --> 00:01:37.140
The cake isn't overly sweet,
it doesn't taste fake,

00:01:37.140 --> 00:01:38.720
it just doesn't really
taste like anything.

00:01:38.720 --> 00:01:40.730
I mean, this is a pretty
classic red velvet cake.

00:01:40.730 --> 00:01:44.340
It's just a vehicle to
get cream cheese frosting

00:01:44.340 --> 00:01:45.410
into my mouth.

00:01:45.410 --> 00:01:46.680
I'm gonna give it two and a half.

00:01:46.680 --> 00:01:48.750
This cake was trying really hard,

00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:51.000
but it just didn't live
up to its potentials.

00:01:55.580 --> 00:01:56.480
Chocolate.

00:01:56.480 --> 00:01:57.510
This looks great.

00:01:57.510 --> 00:01:58.590
It looks chocolatey.

00:01:58.590 --> 00:02:00.870
It smells really nostalgic,

00:02:00.870 --> 00:02:03.950
like the inside of the
bag of Tootsie Rolls,

00:02:03.950 --> 00:02:05.450
which I think is a good thing.

00:02:06.870 --> 00:02:08.120
She's a sturdy cake.

00:02:08.120 --> 00:02:09.180
She's a thick cake.

00:02:09.180 --> 00:02:11.720
It tastes like cheap Halloween candy,

00:02:11.720 --> 00:02:13.070
but honestly, I kind of like that.

00:02:13.070 --> 00:02:15.560
I pretend to be sophisticated, but um,

00:02:15.560 --> 00:02:16.460
I'm really garbage.

00:02:16.460 --> 00:02:19.260
I just wish the cake were
a little bit more rich.

00:02:19.260 --> 00:02:20.093
Three stars.

00:02:20.093 --> 00:02:22.130
It's a chocolate cake, guys.

00:02:22.130 --> 00:02:23.030
How can it be bad?

00:02:28.417 --> 00:02:29.250
Wow.

00:02:30.140 --> 00:02:31.130
She's dense.

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:32.300
It didn't really rise.

00:02:32.300 --> 00:02:33.133
There's no webbing.

00:02:33.133 --> 00:02:34.460
It doesn't look spongy.

00:02:34.460 --> 00:02:36.990
If you can mess up
making a boxed cake mix,

00:02:36.990 --> 00:02:39.810
it's not you, it's the cake mix.

00:02:41.020 --> 00:02:41.853
Oh, yeah.

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:45.860
It's chewy, like nougat.

00:02:45.860 --> 00:02:47.880
Gummy has no place in a cake.

00:02:47.880 --> 00:02:49.660
The flavor is really good.

00:02:49.660 --> 00:02:52.660
It tastes like real vanilla, real butter.

00:02:52.660 --> 00:02:54.460
If this had been light and airy,

00:02:54.460 --> 00:02:55.690
this would've been phenomenal.

00:02:55.690 --> 00:02:57.440
I'm gonna have to give
this cake half a star.

00:02:57.440 --> 00:03:00.650
Flavor's great, the
texture needs some help.

00:03:00.650 --> 00:03:02.140
There is no shame in the box.

00:03:02.140 --> 00:03:05.870
It's quick and easy and
the results are delicious,

00:03:05.870 --> 00:03:08.740
but honestly, it takes just
about the same amount of time

00:03:08.740 --> 00:03:10.340
to make a cake from scratch.

00:03:10.340 --> 00:03:11.740
If you have the right recipe,

00:03:11.740 --> 00:03:14.120
the results are way more delicious.

00:03:14.120 --> 00:03:17.830
I encourage you step outside of the box,

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:19.020
especially when it comes to cake.

00:03:19.020 --> 00:03:21.870
Or, of course, you can support
your local pastry chefs

00:03:21.870 --> 00:03:24.130
and go buy some of their cakes.

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:26.614
Shameless plug.

00:03:26.614 --> 00:03:29.197
(upbeat music)

00:03:30.228 --> 00:03:32.569
(door creaking)

